     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Awareness of road safety and potential social problems strengthened 
Indicator: 40% of community residents, 50% of whom are women, report on improved knowledge and understanding of road safety measures 
Achievement: 50 
Progress/Status: Road safety training has been conducted for the local residents and school students. As of 31 December 2024, total of 84,525 (108.57% of the training target) persons including 42,715 female (50.54%), have reported on improved knowledge and understanding of road safety measures. 
Data Source: MRD project progress reports</narrative>
    </description>
